              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-volt-400 mx-auto mb-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.036A11.959 11.959 0 013.598 6 11.99 11.99 0 003 9.749c0 5.592 3.824 10.29 9 11.623 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.31-.21-2.571-.598-3.751h-.152c-3.196 0-6.1-1.248-8.25-3.285z"/></svg>
              <div class="font-semibold text-white text-sm group-hover:text-volt-400 transition-colors">Compare Insurance</div>
              <div class="text-[10px] text-silver-500 mt-1">See how rates differ between vehicles</div>
            </a>
